flowchart TD
  accTitle: Alpha promotion fallback when Google Play requires Console review
  accDescr: PR 146 first commits the Alpha edit normally. Only the specified HTTP 400 Play error triggers a retry with changesNotSentForReview=true. A successful retry reports pending-console-review and directs the operator to send changes for review in Google Play Console; all other failures follow error reporting.

  start[PR 146: commit verified Alpha edit] --> initial[Initial Play edit commit]
  initial --> result{Result}
  result -->|Success| submitted[Submitted]
  result -->|Specified HTTP 400 and exact review message| retry[Retry with changesNotSentForReview=true]
  result -->|Any other failure| initialError[Report Alpha commit error]
  retry --> retryResult{Retry result}
  retryResult -->|Success| pending[pending-console-review]
  pending --> action[Operator sends changes for review in Google Play Console]
  retryResult -->|Failure| deferredError[Report unreachable Play or deferred commit rejection]
  pending --> checks[Workflow summary, validator, and negative test]
